		<name>Glades Park Towers (GP-92)</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/92.jpg">

<p>The Glades Park Towers is one of the newest housing buildings on the Boca Campus. The building is located on the south end of the Campus off Indian River Street. Parking is available next to the building.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10412046203282,26.36775310100307,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
	<Placemark id="DP49">
		<name>Gladys Davis Pavilion - Center for Global Engagement(DP-49)</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/49.jpg">

<p>The Gladys Davis Pavilion houses the Recording for the Blind and Dyslexic. It is located off of West University Drive and parking is conveniently located next to the building.</p>]]></description>
