		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/89.jpg">

<p>The Heritage Park Towers are located in the heart of campus near the south end of the Breezeway. Parking is available in Lots 22, 23, 24 and 25.</p>]]></description>
