		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/41.jpg">

<p>The Information Booth is the small building on the right as you enter FAU&#39;s main entrance off Glades Road. Visitors may stop by the Information Booth to pick up a temporary hangtag for free parking during their visit or ask for directions.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
