	<Placemark id="IS04">
		<name>Instructional Services (IS-4)</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/4.jpg">

<p>Instructional Services is located near the Library&#39;s 24 hour study area. There are a few metered parking spaces in Lot 19 but students can also park in Parking Garage I. Newly renovated, this is one of the University&#39;s original buildings, housing FAU&#39;s instructional television studios and production facilities, teleconferencing services, audio/visual media services, instructional photography and graphics, and the instructional design and development center. Marketing and Creative Services recently moved into this facility.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10368407,26.3712146,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
