		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/77.jpg">

<p>The Student Services Pavilion is next door to the bookstore and across the lawn from Starbucks. The Pavilion houses an ATM machine and has a small room that often has religious services.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10347486000001,26.37075801,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
	<Placemark id="CC45A">
		<name>Peter and Nona Gordon Library and Media Center (CC-45A)</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>The Peter and Nona Gordon Library and Media Center is located at the Bezos Academy Boca Raton. The library was built through a donation by the Nona Gordon family in 1998. The library is used by the students at Henderson School and the Bezos Academy Boca Raton.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.095063,26.372669,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
