		<name>Phil Smith Hall, College of Business (BU-86)</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/86.jpg">
<p>Located toward the western end of North University Drive. It is easy to reach from West University Drive or North University Drive. Convenient parking is located in Parking Garage I or Lot 7.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10474086000001,26.37316589,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
	<Placemark id="PS55">
		<name>Physical Science Building (PS-55)</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/55.jpg">

<p>The Physical Sciences Building is a three story building located between the Administation building and the Science and Engineering Building. Student parking is available on the east side, in Lots 4 and 5. There are a few metered spaces in Lot 4.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10166168000001,26.37281985,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
