		<description><![CDATA[<img src="https://www.fau.edu/mobile/images/buildings/35.jpg">

<p>The Plant Growth Complex is located at the north end of the Breezeway next to the Behavioral Science building. Student parking is located in Lots 5 and 7.</p>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10273457,26.37353115,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
