	<Placemark id="brBookstore">
		<name>Bookstore</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>The Florida Atlantic University Bookstore is located at the South end of the Breezeway across from the Cafeteria and near Starbucks. Purchase books, scantrons, snacks and other student needs.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><B>Location:</b> BK-76</li>
		<li><a href="http://www.fau.edu/business-services/bookstore/index.php" target="_blank">Website</a></li>
