	<Placemark id="brHousing">
		<name>Housing and Residential Life</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Housing and Residential Life creates safe and diverse living communities for students through quality residential facilities. We deliver impactful programs and services focused on academic success, critical thinking, career exploration and social responsibility that provide and enhance skills for life-long learning.</p>
