	<Placemark id="brInternational">
		<name>International Services</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>We host more than 1200 international students, scholars and their families representing more than 110 countries. Our goal is to ensure that you have a positive and productive experience while at FAU, and – along with reaching your academic objectives – that you enjoy our diverse university community and campus life.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><B>Location:</b> DP-49</li>
