	<Placemark id="brSHS">
		<name>Student Health Services &amp; Clinic</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Student Health Services provides best-in-class accredited medical care to registered FAU Students. Our student-focused services serve as a primary care solution to all FAU commuter and residential students. Schedule an appointment today or stop in to visit our medical, dental or women's health clinic across three FAU campuses.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><B>Location:</b> SS-8W, Room 240</li>
		<li><a href="http://www.fau.edu/shs" target="_blank">Website</a></li>
		<li><a href="tel:15612973512">561-297-3512</a></li>
	</ul>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10324300000001,26.370405,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
	<Placemark id="brSIL">
		<name>Student Involvement and Leadership</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>No matter what time of day or which day of the week it is, there is something in which you can get involved in. By joining one of FAU's 200 student clubs and organizations you can make the campus feel like a smaller place. You have the opportunity to make new friends outside the classroom. You can develop leadership, management and interpersonal skills by taking on responsibilities within your student organization. Most of all, you can contribute something worthwhile to yourself and the FAU community by being an active part of it!</p>
	<ul>
		<li><B>Location:</b> UN-31, Second Floor</li>
		<li><a href="https://www.fau.edu/involvement/" target="_blank">Website</a></li>
		<li><a href="tel:15612973730">561-297-3735</a></li>
	</ul>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10617365678286,26.37022767857353,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
	<Placemark id="brTesting">
		<name>Testing &amp; Evaluation, Prometric, Test Prep</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>CLEP/DSST testing, makeup exams, academic competency exams, graduate school admission tests, correspondence testing, and professional certification and licensure exams.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><B>Location:</b> SU-80, Room 210</li>
		<li><a href="http://www.fau.edu/testing/" target="_blank">Website</a></li>
		<li><a href="tel:15612973160">561-297-3160</a></li>
	</ul>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10560989,26.36923444,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
	<Placemark id="brTransfer">
		<name>Transfer Student Services</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Transfer Student success is highly valued at Florida Atlantic University. In an effort to prioritize this initiative FAU has developed a team of individuals who represent each campus within the institution. These staff members represent a dynamic partnership between the Division of Academic Affairs and the Division of Student Affairs. This team empowers the FAU community by bringing awareness to transfer student needs.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><B>Location:</b> SU-80, Room 214</li>
		<li><a href="http://www.fau.edu/transfer/" target="_blank">Website</a></li>
		<li><a href="mailto:transfer@fau.edu">transfer@fau.edu</a></li>
		<li><a href="tel:15612972733">561-297-2733</a></li>
	</ul>]]></description>
		<Point>
			<coordinates>-80.10560989,26.36923444,0</coordinates>
		</Point>
	</Placemark>
