		<description><![CDATA[Looking for more structured activity? Try out one of the group fitness classes, sign-up for a personal trainer, join an intramural or club sport team, or even swim a few laps in the outdoor pool. For more details check out their website http://www.fau.edu/campusrec/ ]]></description>
