		<description><![CDATA[Did you know FAU has the only climbing center in Palm Beach County which includes a 30 foot rock wall? They offer free open climb times on Wednesdays from 5-7pm and Sundays from 2-5pm. Check out our website for more information http://www.fau.edu/campusrec/challenge_course/climb.php]]></description>
